OL,3,GNEWSAConstruction on new river bridge
OL,4,Abegins
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been warned that
OL,7,Fbuilding works on a controversial #14m
OL,8,Ffoot and cycle bridge over a river may
OL,9,Fbe "disruptive".
OL,11,FConstruction has begun on the Oxpens
OL,12,FRiver Bridge in Oxford, which will
OL,13,Fprovide a new crossing between Oxpens
OL,14,FMeadow to Grandpont Nature Park,
OL,15,Flinking southern and western areas with
OL,16,Fthe city centre.
OL,18,FAnna Railton, deputy leader of Oxford
OL,19,FCity Council, said: "The building work
OL,20,Fwill be disruptive for some residents,
OL,21,Fbut we will make every effort to keep
OL,22,Fthis to a minimum during construction."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
